      "meta_description": "Nearby, costly billboards of the Canadian Association of Petroleum Producers, trying to look good. Our country is turning into a corrupt oil republic, but these folks make it sound like they're doing us a favour. There's an old saying: the bigger the lie, the more people believe it. But more and more of us are waking up. \n\t\n\tStop the Tar Sands - Ottawa Action: <a href=\"http://ottawaaction.ca/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">ottawaaction.ca/</a>\n\t\n\tIn the media: \n\t<a href=\"http://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/ottawa/story/2011/09/26/ottawa-oilsands-protest-parliament-hill.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">www.cbc.ca/news/canada/ottawa/story/2011/09/26/ottawa-oil...</a>\n\t\n\tSustainable/Green Energy Links, Organizations, Jobs\n\t<a href=\"http://planetfriendly.net/energy.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">planetfriendly.net/energy.html</a>\n\t\n\tClimate Change Links, Groups, Organizations\n\t<a href=\"http://planetfriendly.net/climate_change.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">planetfriendly.net/climate_change.html</a>"
